# HTTP security headers (PLAN §8.2), served by Cloudflare for every response.
#
# CSP note — accepted risk, per the plan's own fallback: PLAN §8.2 wanted
# sha256 hashes for Next's inline bootstrap scripts, but the App Router
# export carries ~139 unique inline scripts across 19 pages (~7.5 KB of
# hashes) against Cloudflare's 2,000-character-per-header limit, so hashing
# is not viable and script-src falls back to 'unsafe-inline' as §8.2
# sanctions. The exposure is small: no user input is ever rendered, content
# comes only from authenticated editors through Tina's renderer, and the
# other layers (no server runtime, no dangerouslySetInnerHTML, strict
# remaining directives) still hold. Record stays in MAINTENANCE.md at step 10.
#
# frame-ancestors 'self' (not DENY): Tina's contextual editing iframes the
# site from same-origin /admin. HSTS deliberately ships without `preload`
# (§8.2 — hard to reverse; noted as a later option).
# The Cloudflare hosts are the analytics beacon + Turnstile (PLAN §9, §8.3).

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

# The Tina admin SPA needs the TinaCloud hosts — taken from the Tina CSP
# docs (tina.io/docs/guides/csp-configuration, checked 2 Sep 2026), not
# guessed, per PLAN §8.2. The `!` line detaches the site-wide CSP so the
# admin gets its own. Both /admin and /admin/* so the bare path matches.

/admin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://assets.tina.io; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://identity.tinajs.io https://identity-v2.tinajs.io https://content.tinajs.io https://assets.tinajs.io https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com https://us.i.posthog.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'

/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://assets.tina.io; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://identity.tinajs.io https://identity-v2.tinajs.io https://content.tinajs.io https://assets.tinajs.io https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com https://us.i.posthog.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
